						description_html: "The <code>cubic-bezier()</code> CSS easing function interpolates along a smooth curve, creating animations and transitions with continuous changes in speed. The <code>ease</code>, <code>ease-in</code>, <code>ease-out</code>, and <code>ease-in-out</code> keyword values are presets for common Bézier curves.",
